<title>JAPAN: Nippon Broadcasting to list shares in December.</title>
<headline>Nippon Broadcasting to list shares in December.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Broadcasting System Inc said on Thursday that it will list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's second section on December 2.</p>
</text>
